direction: right
title: "Gambit modern C: one semantic contract across control, GC/SMP and builds"
"semantic": "semantic\nClosed semantic plan and ordered module\ncontract"
"native": "native\nC ABI, trampoline and exact layout adapters"
"execution": "execution\nStable context identity with explicit\njoin/leave and last-user closure"
"roots": "roots\nEpoch-bound root slots and scan grants with\nreload obligations"
"collector": "collector\nComplete work context with parent/child/Tail\ncustody and phase closure"
"control": "control\nRoot-complete frame traversal and resumption\norigins"
"foreign": "foreign\nAdmitted host entry, block transition and\nexplicit result/control boundary"
"release": "release\nAccepted task custody and exactly owned\ncompletion/result disposition"
"build": "build\nSource/plan/generated/object/link lineage and\neffective multicore ABI"
"semantic" -> "native": "PlanAbi"
"native" -> "execution": "GeneratedCheckpoint"
"control" -> "collector": "ControlRoots"
"roots" -> "collector": "RootCut"
"execution" -> "collector": "WorkClosure"
"foreign" -> "execution": "Participation"
"release" -> "execution": "OutcomeLifetime"
"build" -> "native": "ArtifactClosure"
"collector" -> "release": "ReleaseDrain"
proof: "SysML -> ASCENT -> QNT / Lean\nFinite / conditional checks; whole source and native OPEN"
"build" -> proof
idea0: "logical-frames\nFails if duplicated layout decisions remain or\nframe/reflection observations change"
idea0 -> proof
idea1: "bidirectional-target\nFails if native-only edits unnecessarily redo\nexpansion or semantic edits incorrectly hit old\ncache"
idea1 -> proof
idea2: "explicit-storage\nFails on any missed mature-to-young writer,\nunrooted native alias, or shared mutable\ncompiler state"
idea2 -> proof
idea3: "measurement-feedback\nFails when saved work does not exceed added\nvalidation, coordination, copies and retained\nstorage"
idea3 -> proof
